{"id":"n77554-1-2","stage":1,"title":"천만 · 许多","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77554-1-2-1","ko":"소개팅으로 만난 여자 어땠어?","zh":"通过相亲认识的那个女生怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소개팅으로","meaning":"相亲","explanation":"소개팅：相亲；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"소개팅","audio":"/audio/eeb441c4ef6cc8bc32cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64308","senseId":"1","lemma":"소개팅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소개팅으로","audio":"/audio/d8ddc228d02f899aeeac.mp3"}},{"text":"만난","meaning":"遇到","explanation":"만나다：遇到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"9","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만난","audio":"/audio/59a56b665b0716f1d6e1.mp3"}},{"text":"여자","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"eeb441c4ef6cc8bc","term":"소개팅","zh":"相亲","audio":"/audio/eeb441c4ef6cc8bc32cf.mp3","entryId":"64308","definition":"在中间介绍男女一对一见面。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"遇到","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"因有缘而建立某种关系。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女子，女人","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"作为女性出生的人。","pronu